  (text "Safety inputs: 2 e-stops + 2 lidars, 24 V through PC817 - shield for Arduino UNO R4 WiFi / UNO Q" (at 55.88 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 50ec5c59-1807-5e24-b8ec-ef5ded1a637b))
  (text "E-stop loops: 3.3 k -> 6.3 mA (0.20 W at 28.8 V).  Lidar inputs: 4.7 k -> 4.4 mA (0.14 W).  R1-R4 are 1/2 W (body 9 x 3.2 mm); pull-ups 1/4 W." (at 55.88 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5a0a1380-da8f-52e3-9b0a-17e70fb2343b))
  (text "C1-C4 are OPTIONAL: fitted, an opening shorter than about 1.5 ms is not seen by the Arduino, and every stop is seen about 1.6 ms later." (at 55.88 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 37078373-a7f1-5bee-97c7-7c870534c908))
  (text "No current (button pressed, zone occupied, wire cut, 24 V lost) -> pin HIGH = STOP.  F1 protects the 24 V wires going out to the buttons." (at 55.88 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d5196516-458d-5572-a688-b6ddf0a18b81))
  (text "GND_24V and GND are NOT connected: this is the isolation barrier.  Pull-ups go to IOREF (5 V on UNO R4 WiFi, 3.3 V on UNO Q), never to 5V." (at 55.88 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 93ba6b1b-cdfa-5944-852a-272bfad56d7b))
  (text "ISOLATION" (at 143.51 168.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid de4c149e-a740-5619-a572-6583f20e8c9b))
